  "description": "The Batch MB.1 is a confident, no-fuss mountain bike that brings comfort, control, and real trail capability to new riders and weekend explorers. Its hydroformed aluminum frame is lightweight and strong, while the Suntour XCE suspension fork with 100mm of travel helps absorb bumps and keeps handling predictable when the road gets rough.\nThe MB.1 rolls on wide 2.4” all-terrain tires for traction across pavement, paths, and park trails, while the 8-speed drivetrain gives you the gearing you need to tackle hills, flats, and everything in between. With multiple wheel size options and a clean, straightforward design, it’s the perfect intro to off-road adventures — or just a better way to roll around town.",
